:"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日のライブは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体感時間がとても短くて\nあっという間でした！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しい時間ってあっという間に過ぎるよね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仙台は他の会場に比べて\n距離感が近い気がするので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんの声や反応が\nダイレクトに届いてきます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから盛り上がりが直に伝わって\nとても嬉しいし楽しいのです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんのこともよく見えるよ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日来てくれる皆さん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山反応して、\n沢山盛り上がってくれたら嬉しいな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お願いします(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんがオススメしてくれた\nポニーテールもしてみたよ( ◦˙ ˙◦ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真洋も褒めてくれた。。\n嬉しかったからまたポニーテールしようっと♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はファッションではなくて、\nメイクについて(｡･o･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の\"唇\"を作るものたち。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/08/14/0416382/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"typ